          {
            "id": "knowledge_1784490919835_2b4c9ffc",
            "title": "Musa",
            "source": "manual",
            "body": "# Musa Building Supplies\n\n## Business Overview\n\nMusa Building Supplies is a small retail and wholesale business based in **Lagos, Nigeria**. The business sells cement, roofing sheets, blocks, paint, nails, binding wire, and other construction materials.\n\n## Target Customers\n\nOur main customers are:\n\n- Building contractors\n- Artisans\n- Property developers\n- Landlords\n- Individuals working on home renovation projects\n\n## Products and Services\n\n- Cement\n- Roofing sheets\n- Building blocks\n- Paint\n- Nails\n- Binding wire\n- Delivery of construction materials within Lagos\n\n## Sales Approach\n\nWe sell directly from our shop and also take orders by phone and WhatsApp. Repeat customers may receive discounts based on order size and payment history.\n\n## Delivery Policy\n\nWe offer paid delivery within Lagos. Delivery fees depend on distance, vehicle size, and the quantity of goods ordered.\n\n## Credit Policy\n\nCredit is only given to trusted repeat customers. Every credit sale must include:\n\n1. Customer name\n2. Amount owed\n3. Payment deadline\n4. Outstanding balance\n\n## Business Goals\n\n- Increase monthly cement sales\n- Attract more contractors and property developers\n- Reduce unpaid customer debt\n- Improve inventory planning\n- Promote roofing sheets and paint more effectively\n- Build stronger relationships with repeat customers\n\n## Important Business Rules\n\n- Do not record a sale as credit unless credit is explicitly agreed.\n- Do not record delivery or transport as an expense unless the business paid for it.\n- Large cement orders may qualify for a discount.\n- Low-stock products should be reordered before they run out.",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-19T19:55:19.835Z"
          }
        ],
